{"id":"tras","lemma":"tras","pos":"prep","rank":525,"glosses":["after, following, in the wake of; upon","behind (on the far side of)","beyond"],"ipa":"/ˈtɾas/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8d/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-tras.wav","examples":[{"text":"Tom corrió tras Mary.","en":"Tom ran after Mary.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/303511"},{"text":"Corrimos tras el ladrón.","en":"We ran after the thief.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/70218"},{"text":"Vinieron uno tras otro.","en":"They came here one after another.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/687482"},{"text":"Podría llover tras el almuerzo.","en":"It might rain after lunch.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/741222"},{"text":"Cerré la puerta tras de mí.","en":"I shut the door behind me.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/514686"}]}